      "q": "How does 2048 Fibonacci work?",
      "a": "Tiles merge only when they are adjacent neighbors in the Fibonacci sequence: 1 and 1 merge to 2, 1 and 2 merge to 3, 2 and 3 merge to 5, 3 and 5 merge to 8, etc."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the winning tile in 2048 Fibonacci?",
      "a": "The goal is to unlock the 2584 Fibonacci tile!"
    },
    {
      "q": "Can two identical numbers merge?",
      "a": "Only 1 and 1 can merge (since 1 appears twice in the sequence: 1, 1, 2). For higher numbers (like 5 and 5), they do NOT merge—you need 3 and 5 to create 8, or 5 and 8 to create 13."
    }
